  "fixture_kind": "authored fictional saved orders only",
  "groups": [
    "The built original tracker saves a real authored order and its new link opens that unchanged saved order in the separate checklist.",
    "Three fictional saved orders render literal text and all stored source labels; no checklist is selected or exportable by default.",
    "Keyboard selection and preview show only two chosen orders in deadline order, preserving mixed-currency strings and before/after timing.",
    "A real browser download completes with exact selected literal facts, six blank checks, self-contained styles and no unselected order or creation metadata.",
    "The actually downloaded file reopens through file:// with networking offline and matches the reviewed sheet exactly.",
    "The downloaded file has a real print-media layout and produces a native Chrome PDF while retaining source labels and limitations.",
    "An actual removal in the original tracker makes the other tab’s preview stale and disables export without silently replacing the sheet.",
    "Explicit refresh loads current records and clears the prior selection and preview.",
    "Changing the planned date or clearing the selected orders retires the old preview before a new download.",
    "The final download guard catches a same-tab raw change even without a storage event, preserving the changed saved bytes.",
    "A read-access failure at download time is actionable and prevents export without any attempted storage write.",
    "Malformed saved JSON remains intact, with no empty-list disguise, row dropping or reset.",
    "Duplicate identities are refused and a genuinely empty store offers the tracker/refresh path, without altering either value.",
    "A blocked localStorage property getter also reaches the actionable read-error state.",
    "At 390px the selected user-adjusted order stays within the viewport and actually downloads its own one-order checklist.",
    "The one-order download reopens offline on a narrow screen with the same amount, source and usable page width.",
    "Every tracked source byte remains unchanged; the receiver used no external request and observed no product script error."
  ],
